{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Paul Idlout (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that as a youth, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Idlout\" title=\"Paul Idlout\">Paul Idlout</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> was <a href=\"/wiki/High_Arctic_relocation\" title=\"High Arctic relocation\">relocated to the high Arctic</a> by the Canadian government?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Idlout","retrieved":1772172585168},{"title":"a golden branch (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Bough_(Aeneid)\" title=\"Golden Bough (Aeneid)\">a golden branch</a></b> in Virgil's <i><a href=\"/wiki/Aeneid\" title=\"Aeneid\">Aeneid</a></i> inspired <a href=\"/wiki/The_Golden_Bough_(painting)\" title=\"The Golden Bough (painting)\">a painting</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/J._M._W._Turner\" title=\"J. M. W. Turner\">Turner</a>, poems by <a href=\"/wiki/W._B._Yeats\" title=\"W. B. Yeats\">Yeats</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Golden_Bough\" title=\"The Golden Bough\">an anthropological study</a> of ritual murder?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Bough_(Aeneid)","retrieved":1772172585169},{"title":"Base Set (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a box of apparently unopened <b><a href=\"/wiki/Base_Set_(Pok%C3%A9mon)\" title=\"Base Set (Pokémon)\">Base Set</a></b> card packs was purchased by <a href=\"/wiki/Logan_Paul\" title=\"Logan Paul\">Logan Paul</a> for $3.5&nbsp;million, only for it to turn out to be fake?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base_Set_(Pok%C3%A9mon)","retrieved":1772172585169},{"title":"Thandiwe Abdullah (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Thandiwe_Abdullah\" title=\"Thandiwe Abdullah\">Thandiwe Abdullah</a></b> created Black Lives Matter in Schools when she was 15 to help promote <a href=\"/wiki/Anti-racism\" title=\"Anti-racism\">racial justice</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thandiwe_Abdullah","retrieved":1772172585172},{"title":"This Monster Wants to Eat Me (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that imagery of the ocean in <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/This_Monster_Wants_to_Eat_Me\" title=\"This Monster Wants to Eat Me\">This Monster Wants to Eat Me</a></b></i> has been interpreted as a visual metaphor for depression?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/This_Monster_Wants_to_Eat_Me","retrieved":1772172585175},{"title":"Edward R. Kone (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Edward_R._Kone\" title=\"Edward R. Kone\">Edward R. Kone</a></b> had the ugliest face his father had ever seen?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_R._Kone","retrieved":1772172585190},{"title":"Siege of Naples (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that during the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Siege_of_Naples_(536)\" title=\"Siege of Naples (536)\">Siege of Naples</a></b>, local Jews mounted the strongest resistance against the attacking Byzantines in 536?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Naples_(536)","retrieved":1772172585192},{"title":"John Ducey (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that prior to operating the <a href=\"/wiki/Edmonton_Eskimos_(baseball)\" title=\"Edmonton Eskimos (baseball)\">Edmonton Eskimos</a>, baseball executive <b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Ducey_(baseball)\" title=\"John Ducey (baseball)\">John Ducey</a></b> arranged games while an altar boy?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Ducey_(baseball)","retrieved":1772172585195},{"title":"a mysterious ghost girl (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, when asked about <b><a href=\"/wiki/Hex_Maniac\" title=\"Hex Maniac\">a mysterious ghost girl</a></b> in <i>Pokémon</i>, producer <a href=\"/wiki/Junichi_Masuda\" title=\"Junichi Masuda\">Junichi Masuda</a> laughed and said \"oOoOoOoO\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hex_Maniac","retrieved":1772172585196},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<style data-mw-dedupl